'''Pokota''' (ポコタ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pokota
|image = E 399.png
|appearance = [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 550¢ - 2,172¢
}}

==Enemy==
Pokota is a backliner who interestingly has a multi-hit attack. At his highest strength ([[Rainbow Blast!]] at 3 crown difficulty), he sports 128,000 health and does 10,000 damage with each part of his multi-hit attack. In the field, he's a bruiser to Cat Units who aren't able to outrange him and, despite being a backliner, he attacks more frequently than his allies ([[Ovis (Enemy)|Ovis]] or [[Coco (Enemy)|Coco]]).

==Strategy==
As Pokota's damage output is fairly high, it's important to bring meatshields so that he doesn't piledrive the more important units on your team. [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] should be sufficient for the combination of Pokotas, Ovis, and Cocos that are present in [[Rainbow Blast!]].

